
//
// This file defines which skill objects appear for each map and
// villain group.
//
// When a mission map is created, SkillObjective_it tries to find an exact match of the
// (map, SkillObjective_group) pair in this file. If it does not find one, SkillObjective_it tries to
// match an entry which only has the map specified. If it still does not
// find one, SkillObjective_it tries to match an entry which has only the villain group
// specified.
//

